# NOTE: data/egfr_chembl.parquet is deliberately NOT ignored.
# It is an unreproducible INPUT, not a regenerable output. It came from a
# ChEMBL release that has since been superseded, and the 6000-compound working
# set is drawn with df_full.sample(), which samples BY POSITION — so
# reproducing the published pool requires that exact file with its exact row
# order, not merely the same ChEMBL release. At 336 KB it needs no LFS.
 
